<title>USA: Continental Airlines cuts fares to Europe.</title>
<headline>Continental Airlines cuts fares to Europe.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Airlines Inc said Thursday it cut fares to Europe by up to 40 percent for travel through mid-December.</p>
<p>The fares apply to travel from all U.S. points to the European cities of London, Manchester, Madrid and Paris, the airline said.</p>
<p>Sale fares apply for travel from October 1 through December 18.</p>
<p>The Non-refundable round-trip tickets must by purchased by September 24 and must include a Saturday night stay, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
